# İlk kurulumdan sonra neden/dil/vergi/ekmek yalnız gerçek Windows girdisidir.
# Root her yeni checkpoint'i gördükten sonra sonraki75 saniyelik pencereye geçer.
new
lang ru
select champagne
panel journal
expect ResistanceActive True
expect ResistanceTroops 1114
expect Troops 1200
expect Gold 840
expect Food 360
expect SelectedUnrest 69
expect SelectedControl 60.5
expect SelectedRegionId champagne
expect BattleActive False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
remember untouched-resistance
wait 0.8
state 00-start
shot 00-start

# Pencere1: root gerçek ok tıklamasıyla neden açıklamasını açar.
wait 75
same untouched-resistance
expect Language ru
expect ResistanceTroops 1114
state 01-native-why-ru
shot 01-native-why-ru

# Pencere2: gerçek RU/TR, açıklama oku ve gerekli gerçek scroll.
# Script dil değiştirmez; neden metninin gerçekten görünmesini root PNG'de inceler.
wait 75
same untouched-resistance
expect Language tr
expect ResistanceTroops 1114
state 02-native-why-tr
shot 02-native-why-tr

# Pencere3: gerçek Tax, root'un1234 inputPNG'si, sonra gerçek Bread.
# Bu aralıkta act/commission/accord veya durum yazan bir hazırlık komutu yoktur.
wait 75
expect Language tr
expect SelectedRegionId champagne
expect ResistanceActive True
expect ResistanceTroops 1106
expect SelectedUnrest 66
expect SelectedControl 62.5
expect Gold 940
expect Food 320
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
expect MilitarySupplies 120
expect Morale 78
expect Supply 100
expect Power 55
expect Moves 2
expect Fatigue 0
expect ArmyRegionId ile
expect HasOfficerCommission False
expect DumasExtraRecruitUsed False
expect HasAccord False
expect BattleActive False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
expect HasPendingVictory False
expect Week 0
state 03-native-tax-bread
shot 03-native-tax-bread
save
remember native-tax-bread
select normandy
load
same native-tax-bread
expect SelectedRegionId champagne
expect ResistanceTroops 1106
expect BattleActive False
state 04-native-tax-bread-loaded
shot 04-native-tax-bread-loaded
quit
